    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are okay, but they feel a bit dry and maybe a little \"robotic\" for our brand voice. we want to feel like a modern fintech, not a legacy bank.\n\ncan you try to refine these? specifically, try to pull that positivity score up a bit—we want users to feel supported rather than just being told \"no.\" \n\nremember though, please don't just keyword-stuff with happy words or make it sound weirdly cheerful/bubbly. it's still a serious compliance issue involving a lot of money, so the tone needs to stay grounded. just aim for a slightly more \"positive\" and reassuring vibe than the first batch. maybe try to get them closer to a 0.8 or 0.9 on that sentiment scale without losing the professionalism?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
